<Slide notes={`合同放进请求是这样写的。

用的是 responses.create，model 由环境变量 OPENAI_MODEL 指定。instructions 约束行为：只依据材料安排活动，严格保留人数、时长和房间限制；input 放材料。

关键是 text 这一段：type 是 json_schema，name 起名 open_day_schedule，strict 为 True，schema 就是从文件读入的合同。

这是 structured_schedule.py 请求结构的简化摘示，materials 与 schema 由脚本从文件读取。所选模型必须实际支持该功能。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 64px' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 44, background: '#276FBF' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>2.4.3　使用 Responses 的 text.format</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>把合同放进请求</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 16 }}>

        <Box style={{ height: 300, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 12, padding: '22px 26px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontFamily: 'Consolas, monospace', color: '#20344B', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>{'response = client.responses.create('}</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontFamily: 'Consolas, monospace', color: '#20344B', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>{'    model=os.environ["OPENAI_MODEL"],'}</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontFamily: 'Consolas, monospace', color: '#276FBF', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>{'    instructions="只依据提供材料安排活动，严格保留人数、时长和房间限制。",'}</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontFamily: 'Consolas, monospace', color: '#20344B', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>{'    input=materials,'}</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontFamily: 'Consolas, monospace', color: '#CB6B28', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>{'    text={"format": {"type": "json_schema",'}</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontFamily: 'Consolas, monospace', color: '#CB6B28', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>{'                     "name": "open_day_schedule",'}</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontFamily: 'Consolas, monospace', color: '#CB6B28', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>{'                     "strict": True, "schema": schema}},'}</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontFamily: 'Consolas, monospace', color: '#20344B', lineHeight: 1.9 }}>{')'}</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 130, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 560, height: 130, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 10, padding: '16px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>参数各管一段</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>instructions 约束依据与保留项，input 放教学材料，text.format 放合同。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 560, height: 130, background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 10, padding: '16px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#CB6B28' }}>这是简化摘示</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>materials 与 schema 由脚本从文件读取；模型由 OPENAI_MODEL 指定，且需实际支持该功能。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>2.4 结构化输出</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>14 / 23</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
